  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Stronger Threads for Functional 3D Prints</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Printed plastic threads can wear out or strip over time, especially in parts that are assembled and disassembled repeatedly. Brass heat-set inserts provide durable metal threads, helping improve assembly strength and making printed parts more suitable for repeated fastening.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/494bc397318246cabe06ba1155b3efe3/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/494bc397318246cabe06ba1155b3efe3/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Multiple Sizes for Common Insert Standards</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The included heat-insert tooling supports common insert sizes used in 3D printing, including M2, M2.5, M3, M4, M5, M6, and M8. This makes it easier to handle a wide range of printed enclosures, brackets, and functional assemblies.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c6fa662995fa4247b8f20c1caf5b90f2/B-QA004_banner_3_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c6fa662995fa4247b8f20c1caf5b90f2/B-QA004_banner_3_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Will this fit my soldering iron?</span></h3>\n<p class=\"pct_hstn-compat-note\">The included adapter is designed for 900M / T18-style removable-tip soldering irons. Other soldering iron systems may require a different adapter.</p>\n<!-- PC端表格：尽量保持原样 -->\n<div class=\"pct_tbc pct_hstn-compat-desktop\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-table-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 477px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; width: 102.637px; height: 27px;\">Your iron</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; width: 125.35px; height: 27px;\">Fits with included adapter?</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; width: 241.488px; height: 27px;\">Notes</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Hakko FX-888D / FX-888, T18-style irons</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Included adapter replaces the standard removable tip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Hakko 936 / 937 / 907 handle</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">900M-style tip interface</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">936-style stations (Yihua, Baku, Kaisi, Aoyue, Vastar, etc.)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Compatible if the iron uses 900M-style removable tips</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Generic adjustable iron using 900M tips</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">Yes</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">60 W or higher recommended</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">TS100 / TS101 / SQ-001 / Pinecil V1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No — different adapter required</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Needs a TS100-style shank; not included</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Pinecil V2</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Different tip interface; TS100 adapters do not fit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">T12 / T15 cartridge irons</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Cartridge heater — this set cannot attach</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">JBC C245 / C210, Aixun, Sugon, Sequre, FNIRSI HS-02A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Cartridge irons; also a different thread than this kit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Weller ET / LT / XT</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Proprietary tip series</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">ERSA 102 / 832 / 842</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Proprietary tip series</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 102.637px;\">Butane or fixed-tip irons</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 125.35px;\">No</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 241.488px;\">Tip must be removable</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 手机端卡片：避免只看到第一列造成误解 -->\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-title\">Hakko FX-888D / FX-888, T18-style irons</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-row\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-label\">Fits?</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-value pct_hstn-compat-yes\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-row pct_hstn-compat-card-row-last\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-label\">Notes</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-value\">Included adapter replaces the standard removable tip</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-title\">Hakko 936 / 937 / 907 handle</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-row\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-label\">Fits?</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-value pct_hstn-compat-yes\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-row pct_hstn-compat-card-row-last\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-label\">Notes</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-value\">900M-style tip interface</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-title\">936-style stations (Yihua, Baku, Kaisi, Aoyue, Vastar, etc.)</div>\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-row\">\n<div class=\"pct_hstn-compat-card-label\">Fits?</d